{"product_id":"wave-pro","title":"Wave Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"53542514-04a7-447c-b6a1-c81cd58127bc\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro Earbuds represent the next generation of in-ear audio, delivering an unparalleled HD sound experience with over 100 hours of playback time. As the industry's first powerhouse earbuds with such longevity, Wave Pro stands out with 5 dual-toned, soft matte finishes, seamlessly blending superior audio performance with cutting-edge style that perfectly matches your fashion sense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro offers an industry-leading 100 hours of playback time, powered by 13mm Bass Drivers that deliver crystal-clear HD sound. Equipped with Quad Mic ENC, the earbuds ensure premium call quality and effective noise cancellation, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Bluetooth 5.3 and Insta-Pair technology, the Wave Pro connects to your device instantly, and a quick charge of just 10 minutes provides 120 minutes of playback. The lightweight, ergonomic design with rounded monochrome tips ensures all-day comfort, while the soft matte, dual-tone rubber finish adds both style and enhanced grip for easy carrying.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro also features AI Voice Assistant with touch controls for seamless hands-free operation. Whether you're using \"Hey Siri\" for iOS or \"Ok Google\" for Android, activating your assistant is as easy as tapping or holding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlayback Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDrivers\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm Hyperbass™ Tech\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLatency\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 10-minute charge = 120 minutes of playtime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/strong\u003e: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Size\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs\u003c\/strong\u003e: AAC, SBC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Fidelity Acoustics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSupported Profiles\u003c\/strong\u003e: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/strong\u003e: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHyperbass™ Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Wave Pro?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro merges fast fashion with disruptive technology. Boasting the largest battery capacity in the industry, superior sound quality, and a sleek dual-tone matte finish, these earbuds are a perfect balance of performance and style. The Wave Pro isn’t just an accessory—it’s a reliable companion that elevates both your listening experience and your sense of style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Orange Black","offer_id":49286916931862,"sku":"22481","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Gray","offer_id":49286910017814,"sku":"22539","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lilic Gray","offer_id":49286909985046,"sku":"22615","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49286909952278,"sku":"22613","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":50027537662230,"sku":"23070","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Ecommerce-Image-1.webp?v=1729196999","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/wave-pro","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}